<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Westinghouse downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Westinghouse downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said it downgraded Westinghouse Electric Corp to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The stock was down 3/8 to 16-7/8.</p>
</text>
